<title>FINLAND: Kemira 1996 profit up 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Kemira 1996 profit up 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     851  vs    718</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    5.1  vs    4.6</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		     1.6  vs    1.5</p>
<p> Net sales					 13,471  vs 13,284</p>
<p> Operating profit				 1,248  vs  1,337</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast had been for a full-year profit before extras and taxes of 848 million markka (mean 840 million) in a 785 million to 907 million markka rang</p>
</text>
